OL,3,AWood Group offshore workers launch
OL,4,A48-hour strike in row over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FOffshore workers on a number of North
OL,7,FSea platforms are taking strike action
OL,8,Fin a dispute over pay and conditions.
OL,10,FThe Unite and RMT unions said they are
OL,11,Fin dispute with the Wood Group over its
OL,12,Fdecision to "slash" the pay and
OL,13,Fconditions of dozens of offshore
OL,14,Fworkers, including through the threat
OL,15,Fof issuing fire-and-rehire notices.
OL,17,FThe strikes will affect a number of
OL,18,Finstallations run by Harbour Energy,
OL,19,Fincluding the Britannia, Jasmine, Judy,
OL,20,FLomond and North Everest platforms.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
