OL,3,AWood Group offshore workers launch
OL,4,A48-hour strike in row over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Wood Group said it had been
OL,7,Fnotified of the action and added that
OL,8,Fstaff and operational safety remained
OL,9,Fits "top priority".
